OL,3,GNEWSAMajor works to start on Brent
OL,4,ACross flyover
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers using the Brent Cross Flyover
OL,7,Fon the A41 or surrounding roads are
OL,8,Fbeing advised to avoid the area or face
OL,9,Flonger journey times as major renewal
OL,10,Fworks get under way.
OL,12,FStarting on Wednesday evening, the
OL,13,Fflyover will be reduced to a single
OL,14,Flane in each direction and a number of
OL,15,Fovernight and weekend closures are
OL,16,Fplanned throughout the works.
OL,18,FThe Transport for London (TfL) scheme
OL,19,Fis the first phase of a programme to
OL,20,Frenew and strengthen the Brent Cross
OL,21,FInterchange - where the A41 and A406
OL,22,FNorth Circular Road cross over.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
